MAIN
MOVE TEMP 7 4
MOVE TEMP 8 HALLOCATE TEMP 7
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 8
MOVE TEMP 9 4
MOVE TEMP 10 HALLOCATE TEMP 9
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 10
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 12 VarTest_ved_UseVariables
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 12
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 13 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 13
PRINT TEMP 4
END
VarTest_ved_UseVariables [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 14 10
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 15 20
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 5
MOVE TEMP 16 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 6
PRINT TEMP 1
PRINT TEMP 2
PRINT TEMP 3

RETURN TEMP 3
END

